{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the world that\u2019s in crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But wait, the hero is a little strange\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How does he defeat the villains?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero\u2019s method is none other than \u201c<strong>mini-games</strong>\u201d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle with monsters is decided through mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the monsters with a variety of mini-games and save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773940/extras/61ae4613b247d48b7361dc4756935185.avif?t=1750445209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773940/extras_big/61ae4613b247d48b7361dc4756935185.avif?t=1750445209 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to use a lot of keys! Four keys, to be exact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up! Down! Left! Right! You\u2019ll solve everything with these!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773940/extras/4c352d2d29a8c29e9b23a26a86ceccb4.avif?t=1750445209\" width=192 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer four stages and make your way to the Demon Castle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773940/extras/f5927fa9bcbc9c1a4b1b9f0ee7a6c870.avif?t=1750445209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773940/extras_big/f5927fa9bcbc9c1a4b1b9f0ee7a6c870.avif?t=1750445209 width=800 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Warning: This process may cause a lot of frustration.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playing solo isn\u2019t nearly as fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>the real fun starts when you play with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aMini Game Hero\u300b</strong> is a casual game where you defeat monsters through a variety of fast-paced mini-games.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mushroom Soup!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773940/bb3b11773527c65b5d3ddac20f52a446b448aead.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat The werewolf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773940/cebb93d684c51da4558b73e10852f424bde94650.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat The NagaWizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773940/30e3c47265a1f2f93d61eab09718a93d92eb0d69.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat The Bishop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773940/41f532e1cfb905325393d795e7f1689785b05562.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat The LizardWarrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773940/0198e0f1414004f2bceaa56bd0ab2e8e143d07ef.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Easy Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773940/e040c0ed7cee8ecdfff2467d27d180216ed9274c.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Normal Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773940/41502f9f22be0834bcc5e3aabf588c119f6824d1.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Hard Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773940/565cd390b456d9f0353054729c689133ed13caab.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/